      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A narrow‑gauge line from the Sedgwick Tie and Timber Company linked Egypt to the Kansas City, Fort Scott and Memphis Railroad, boosting growth.",
